    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi watambikili aIsarela ejima, wayilili nindi, Enu aIsarela tiyenuyidika, nawuŋaji, wunukuhosha lelu kumatu enu kulonda mudizumu, mushuku muchima wakwilamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova Nzambi yetu watiyaŋeni chitiyaŋenu nanetu kuHorebi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chenichi chitiyaŋenu Yehova hachitiyaŋenina wankakulula jetuku, chiŋa nanetu hohu, yetu aweni, yetu amomi ejima tudi kunu lelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli nenu mesu namesu hampidi mukachikakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henahana ami nemeni, Yehova iku, enu iku, ami mukachi, kulonda kuyileja mazu aYehova, muloŋa enu mwatiyili woma wakesi kadiŋuku, himwakandamini hampiduku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili nindi, Yami Yehova Nzambi yeyi nakufumishili mwituŋa daEjipitu mwitala dawuduŋu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwikala nawakishi akulunjika kudami, chinjila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudilila mukishi wakusoŋa wakufwikŋa hela chuma chamwiwulu mumawulu, hela chahamaseki munu mwishina, hela chamumeji mwishina damaseki, chinjila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kudifukula kudi wena hela kuyipesha, chinjila; muloŋa ami Yehova Nzambi yeyi niNzambi wamukawu; kuluwa kwawatata jawantu akakukoola kudi anyanawu, niezukulu awu, nianyana kawezukulu anhelaŋa, dichi chinelaŋa ami Nzambi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakwinza makombakaji awantu ankeŋa ahembaŋa kuleja kwami, nayitiyilaŋa luwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutena ijina daYehova Nzambi yeyi namaswimbu, chinjila; Yehova hakayiŋisha watenaŋa ijina dindi namaswimbuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaku muchima kwifuku dasabata, wudijiliki, mwakulejeliyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku atanu nadimu wakakalakali, wakakoŋi nyidi muyeyi yejima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilaŋa ifuku damu chitanu nachiyedi hisabata yambala yaYehova Nzambi yeyi; ifuku denodu bayi wakakoŋelamu mudimuku, hela eyi, hela mwaneyi weyala, hela mwaneyi wamumbanda, hela ŋamba yeyi weyala, hela ŋamba yeyi wamumbanda, hela ŋombi yeyi, hela chimbulu cheyi, hela chimuna hichimuna cheyi, hela mwenyi weyi wudi hamukalaweyi; kulonda niŋamba yeyi weyala niŋamba yeyi wamumbanda akanookineyi chiwakanookeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakaanukaŋa chiwadiŋi ŋamba mwituŋa daEjiispitu, mwakufumishiliyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi nachikasa chaŋovu, nachikasa chakwolola; dichi chakulejeleliyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi kuhemba ifuku dasabata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
