              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lemeshaku tata yeyi namama yeyi, mwomwakulejeliyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi; kulonda mafuku eyi akavuli, wakashakami chachiwahi mwituŋa dakukwinkayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.16",
