        },
        {
          "text": "Mazu awa Yehova wayiliosheli nachipompelu chenu chejima hampidi, afumini mukesi nimwivu, nimumwidima wakushishita, nezu deneni; halunjikili kwokuku. Wayisonekeli hamalola awubasa ayedi, wayinyinkelami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili chimunatiyi izu hidikufuma mukachi kamwidima, ikumpidi yidi nakubidima kesi, enu himukuswila kwakwihi nanami, wowuanyanta ejima anyichidi yenu, niakulumpi jenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "himukwila nenu, Talenu, Yehova Nzambi yetu natumwekesheli dehi ni kulema kwindi nichatohayi, tunatiyi izu dindi hidikufuma mukesi; lelu tunamoni Nzambi hakuhoshana muntu, muntu saŋi ahandilayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu tukufwiladi? Kesi aka keneni kakutunoŋesha. Neyi tukutiyaŋ tuhu izu daYehova Nzambi yetu tukufwa hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochu hadi antu ejima hadi watiyahu dehi izu daNzambi wamumi hidikuhosha difuma mukachi kakesi, neyi chitunatiyetu, ahanda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaku kwakwihi eyi, wakatiyi mwakuhoshayi Yehova Nzambi yetu mwejima; yejima yakahoshayi Yehova Nzambi yetu naneyi eyi wakahoshinanetu; twakachitiya, twakelamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova watiyili mazu enu mwahosheli, chimwahosheli nanami; Yehova waŋilili, nindi, Natiyi dehi mazu anawa antu anahoshuwu naneyi; mwejima mwanahoshuwu anahoshi chachiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu-u! Neyi mudi wena mwadiŋi muchima wakuntiya woma, wakwilaŋa mwejima munukuyileja mafuku ejima, mutenowu adi kushakama chachiwahi, niwena nianyanawu chahaya nyaka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaku wuyili neyi, Funtenu kumatenti enu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila eyi wukwimana kunu kudami, ami nukuhosha naneyi mwejima nimukuleja, nimuyidika, nimuwuŋaji, muwakayileja wena kulonda akelaŋamu mwituŋa dinakayinka akadiheti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakasha ŋaku muchima wakwila mwakuyilejayi Yehova Nzambi yenu; bayi mwakasenukamu muya hela kuchikasa chachidiilu hela kuchimunswaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayenuŋa munjila yakuyilejayi Yehova Nzambi yenu ho-o, kulonda mwakahandi, mwakashakami chachiwahi, mwakavulishi mafuku enu mwituŋa dimwakaheta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
